        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "By the end of the webinar, participants felt engaged and demonstrated their willingness and motivation to apply some of the concepts they learned while designing their own courses. A participant wrote in their post-webinar, workshop evaluation, \"I really appreciate the relevance of the content to our current issues. Dr. Kolomitro has strong content knowledge and I enjoyed her reflective and engaging style of presenting, as she included real examples from her experience. It really helped me!\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Overall, the webinar was a huge success, as it highlighted important issues around curriculum review with insight on best practices from around the world. "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For more information regarding this webinar or upcoming webinars please visit: www.aku.edu/qtl. If you have any queries, please write to us at "
